OL,3,GNEWSATicketless train travel trial
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial for ticketless train travel
OL,7,Fthat works by tracking passengers'
OL,8,Flocations is being extended for another
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) announced
OL,12,Flast September it would test
OL,13,Fpay-as-you-go technology, which uses
OL,14,Fthe location data of app users' mobile
OL,15,Fphones to see where they have gone and
OL,16,Fcharge them "the best fare at the end
OL,17,Fof the day".
OL,19,FThe trial, which operates between
OL,20,FDerby, Leicester and Nottingham, has
OL,21,Frecorded more than 27,000 journeys by
OL,22,F1,492 participants.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
