OL,3,GNEWSATicketless train travel trial
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FEMR said the app had received high
OL,7,Fsatisfaction scores, and the company
OL,8,Fwas hoping for more passengers to sign
OL,9,Fup to the scheme.
